  "description": "The CORE 3 is the misfit in the new DECOY family and our burliest E-MTB to date. Tapping into our freeride heritage, we've distilled downhill-bike capability into a relentless fun machine, equipping an Öhlins TTX22 m.2 coil rear shock and a tough DH casing rear tire to supercharge its gravity performance. Armed with MX wheels, 180/170mm of suspension, and parts from TRP, SRAM, and Title, it's spec'd for maximum carnage; this a bike built to handle constant abuse on the most brutal terrain out there. Matching its performance demands courage, but with confidence like this, you'll always give it your all.",
